            <ArticleTitle>[The value of anterior stromal puncture in the treatment of bullous keratopathy].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>45-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Results of anterior stromal puncture (ASP) in treatment of painful bullous keratopathy (PBK) are presented and its mechanism of action is hypothesized. ASP is an effective, simple, safe and low-cost procedure for symptomatic relief in patients with PBK.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
